{"id":"5035","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5035_main_cumulus-congestus-and-cirrostratus-with-parhelion-and-partial-22-halo_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这里看到的是浓积云，较窄的云塔切变，以及高积云和卷层云斑块，同时伴有部分22°光晕和来自后者的幻日。一些卷云元素和一层霾（靠近地面）被低太阳照亮。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Irene Ho","location":"中国香港流浮山Pak Nai","latitude":"纬度: 22° 26' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 56' 54'' E","date":"15 July 2010 1828 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 3, CH= 8","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.3"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5035_syn_cumulus-congestus-and-cirrostratus-with-parhelion-and-partial-22-halo_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"></div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/5035_upper_cumulus-congestus-and-cirrostratus-with-parhelion-and-partial-22-halo_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"></div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4766_main_cumulus-congestus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>积云通常是密集的，具有清晰轮廓，以上升的山丘、圆顶或塔等的形式垂直发展。积云通常是分离的云；虽然无法确定这张图像中的这些云是否分离，但是在海岸外的海面上的阴影表明主要细胞有一定程度的分离。它们还有非常<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">明亮的白色阳光照射部分</span>；相对<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">较暗且近水平的云底</span>；与积云有关的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">强垂直范围</span>。值得注意的是，强烈的萌芽、清晰的轮廓和凸起的上部，类似于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>的花椰菜，决定了其为浓云云种。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Alfons Puertas","location":"西班牙巴塞罗那Vallvidrera","latitude":"纬度: 41° 25' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 7' 27'' E","date":"15 September 2015 1406 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.3"}]}]}